# py_steam_net-main's own Rust build output (target/, ~250MB+ of
# incremental compile artifacts) and its bundled maturin/pip venv -
# neither is source, both regenerate from src/+Cargo.toml via
# `maturin build --release --target x86_64-pc-windows-gnu`. Only the
# built wheel (py_steam_net-0.1.0-*.whl, tracked at the repo root) is
# what the game actually depends on at runtime.
py_steam_net-main/target/
py_steam_net-main/.venv/
py_steam_net-main/dist/
